nt strata. This will test whether the large feature_010 effect is robust to potential overlap with feature_003, whose subthreshold negative raw association is now deferred. These refinements do not challenge the accepted unconditional dataset association unless they reveal strong heterogeneity, instability, or coding artifacts. Subsequent analysis should prioritize these feature_010 strata, then use remaining capacity for the untested breadth screens unless scheduled validation or a robust subgroup finding becomes more informative.",
