trata. Some numeric predictors are also not settled because of small cells or inconsistent directions, but they are less central than feature_063 at this point. The next most informative analysis is the proposed H81-parented refinement: feature_063=1 versus 0 among participants with feature_010=0 and feature_037=0. This stratum removes the two strongest core tags, feature_010 and feature_037, while allowing both feature_002=0 and feature_002=1, so it should be larger than the triple-absent residual test and may retain the large feature_063 contrast seen in H81, H84, and H86. If this residual claim clears the threshold and ideally obtains independent validation, I would be willing to regard feature_063 as a meaningful additional measured predictor, at least in well-defined strata. If it attenuates or becomes unstable, I would treat feature_063 more cautiously as correlated with or partly reflecting the existing predictor structure. All conclusions remain descriptive associations in the supplied dataset, not causal claims or statements of external generalizability.",
