ether overlap with negative tags previously diluted a separable signal. Positive thresholds for feature_022 and feature_016 would support conditional positive tags; a negative threshold for feature_017 would support a conditional vulnerability tag; null results argue against treating these rare variables as separable predictors. The age proposal uses a wider feature_019 contrast than earlier tests to examine whether the unresolved feature_019 signal becomes threshold-level, with the anticipated direction older-minus-younger positive. All conclusions remain observational associations in this supplied dataset only; they do not establish causality, mechanism, biological interpretation, clinical relevance, or generalizability. Invalid small-cell results must be treated as unusable evidence, not evidence of absence.",
