re_038, low feature_018, all major positive and negative tags absent; (2) low feature_038, all major positive and negative tags absent; (3) low feature_038, core-negative territory, low feature_018; (4) high feature_038, high feature_018, all major positive and negative tags absent; and (5) the direct feature_063-by-feature_018 interaction in the same high-feature_038, tag-absent setting. These target the remaining boundary between a robust context-specific negative association and an overlocalized/small-cell pattern. All conclusions are associations in the supplied dataset only; they do not establish causality, mechanism, biological meaning, clinical relevance, or generalizability.",
